extends project-item.jade

block content
  .container
    // Portfolio Item Heading
    h1.my-4
      | Meet your Maker
    // Portfolio Item Row
    .row
      .col-md-8.embed-responsive.embed-responsive-4by3
        iframe.embed-responsive-item(src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/i_KKKAKa5Jk", frameborder="0", allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture", allowfullscreen="")
      |         
      .col-md-4
        h3 Project description
        |           
        p(align="justify") 
          | A game of a new gendra about building and combat. Think of a mix of Mario Maker and Doom ;) This game can be played in coop, in which I could get a lot of experience in network programming within Unreal Engine.
        |           
        h3.my-3 Contributions
        |           
        ul
          li Network programming (3Cs, Player Abilities)
          |             
          li Implemented weapons and consumables
          |             
          li Implemented Traps
          |             
          li Improving 3C's, such has the Grappling Hook movement
          |    
          li Adding an interaction system based on Gameplay Ability System
        |           
        h3.my-3 Development details
        |           
        ul
          li Code in C++
          |             
          li Usage of Unreal Engine
          |             
          li Perforce for version control
